    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WARNING: This game contains many scenes with flashing lights and may not be suitable for players with light sensitivity.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Obfuscation</i></strong> is a first person horror game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up in an unfamiliar house, you don't seem to know or remember anything. Explore the house to discover the truth that someone or something is trying to keep in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/6c734273b3f2d0a4f776947a35731ffc.poster.avif?t=1754645137\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/6c734273b3f2d0a4f776947a35731ffc.webm?t=1754645137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/6c734273b3f2d0a4f776947a35731ffc.mp4?t=1754645137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Obfuscation</i>, the boundary of reality melts away. Eerie phenomena, unexplainable encounters distort your perception, leaving you questioning what is real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/07b2cbcdd66779231a8e7d8f47615c8f.poster.avif?t=1754645137\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/07b2cbcdd66779231a8e7d8f47615c8f.webm?t=1754645137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/07b2cbcdd66779231a8e7d8f47615c8f.mp4?t=1754645137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/22b25c969ef622183f5e36dea26f134f.poster.avif?t=1754645137\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/22b25c969ef622183f5e36dea26f134f.webm?t=1754645137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/22b25c969ef622183f5e36dea26f134f.mp4?t=1754645137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/7cb07f4451a1004f5809afdb0e0d3b0f.poster.avif?t=1754645137\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/7cb07f4451a1004f5809afdb0e0d3b0f.webm?t=1754645137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/7cb07f4451a1004f5809afdb0e0d3b0f.mp4?t=1754645137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
